# Applied to the OUT_DIR copy of quickjs.c.
# Module lifetime matches quickjs-ng c40c431ffbe4631c81cb07bec38c76738fb452e0
# (js_free_module_def, JS_ReadModule, JS_TAG_MODULE in js_free_value_rt),
# plus per-runtime create/free counters for the rquickjs leak test.
# The vendored submodule stays at quickjs-ng 0.17.0 because c40c431 also
# sits behind unrelated public API breaks (JS_LoadModule, JSInterruptHandler,
# JSValueUnion). Hunks are exact and applied in order.
